<title>USA: Gateway 2000 to open showrooms.</title>
<headline>Gateway 2000 to open showrooms.</headline>
<dateline>NORTH SIOUX CITY, S.D. 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gateway 2000 Inc said on Friday it will open two factory-direct showrooms in a pilot program to expand its direct-marketing efforts.</p>
<p>The personal computer manufacturer said the showrooms opened this fall in New Haven, Connecticut and Charlotte, North Carolina, will enable customers to test its computers, Gateway said.</p>
<p>The showrooms will be comparable to facilities the company operates in Europe, Asia and Australia. Gateway said it will evaluate the benefit of operating the showrooms before it considers further expansion.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
